{
  "id": "unchanged-statements-and-bytes",
  "goals": [
    "a change of a shared definition that existing theorems and images depend on",
    "a new case of a generator, an initialization list, or a check predicate",
    "a comparison of emitted modules and images before and after a change",
    "genImage m k args room cap o (image + d) = .ok (bytes, L.shift d)",
    "a reformatting of Lean source that must keep every declaration",
    "a structure field moved into a substructure while existing statements name it",
    "a generator with a new entry routine beside the old one",
    "a form whose encoding admits only some values of a parameter, such as the immediate of SUBS",
    "hashes of the declarations of a module before and after a change",
    "an effect, such as a system call, that the instruction type, the decoder, and exec lack",
    "a run of step lifted into a run of a process model with a rule for SVC #0",
    "an import added to a WebAssembly module, which moves every defined function's index",
    "an old theorem proved from its general twin at calls := []",
    "a premise added to a predicate that lemmas take as a hypothesis",
    "tools/DeclHashes.lean fails to import two modules that declare main",
    "a changed type hash of a theorem whose text did not change, from a reused matcher"
  ],
